---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---
<PageLayout title="Resources" subtitle="Printable templates and reference material for your own baking.">

  <div class="grid">
    <div class="card">
      <img src="/images/resources/baking-log-card.jpg" alt="An open baking log notebook next to a jar of sourdough starter" class="card-thumb" />
      <h3>Baking Log</h3>
      <p>A printable template for tracking dough temperature, bulk fermentation timing, the poke test, and crumb results — bake to bake.</p>
      <a href="/resources/baking-log/" class="recipe-link">View &rarr;</a>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <img src="/images/resources/starter-log-card.jpg" alt="A starter-feeding log notebook next to an active sourdough starter" class="card-thumb" />
      <h3>Starter Log</h3>
      <p>A separate template for tracking the starter itself over time — feeding ratio, time-to-peak, hooch frequency, and periodic health check-ins.</p>
      <a href="/resources/starter-log/" class="recipe-link">View &rarr;</a>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <img src="/images/resources/master-playlist-card.jpg" alt="A vinyl turntable next to a freshly baked loaf of sourdough" class="card-thumb" />
      <h3>Master Playlist</h3>
      <p>Every recipe's phase-based playlist combined into one running list, organized Starter Feeding through Bake and Cool, with a table of which recipe each track came from.</p>
      <a href="/resources/master-playlist/" class="recipe-link">View &rarr;</a>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <img src="/images/resources/tools-card.jpg" alt="A granite countertop with a dough-filled bowl on a kitchen scale, a probe thermometer, an aliquot jar, a bench scraper, and a sourdough loaf" class="card-thumb" />
      <h3>Tools</h3>
      <p>The mixers, thermometers, aliquot jars, scrapers, and other gear on my counter, organized by where you'd reach for it in a bake, with the "why" and the honest misses. A living list.</p>
      <a href="/resources/tools/" class="recipe-link">View &rarr;</a>
    </div>
  </div>

</PageLayout>
